# Line endings
#
# Files are stored in the repository with LF line endings. XSLT and Java source
# files are checked out with CRLF line endings on every platform, whatever the
# local core.autocrlf setting. Stylesheet behavior is unaffected: XML parsers
# treat CRLF and LF line endings the same.
*.xsl  text eol=crlf
*.java text eol=crlf
